[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.709, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "很多人可能不了解我们的 YouTube 文化"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4327.681, "timestamp": "01:12:07", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ya"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4328.47, "timestamp": "01:12:08", "text": "等等，对吧？我们可以告诉他们，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.189, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "嗯，这个，它是这个，那个，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4333.83, "timestamp": "01:12:13", "text": "或者告诉他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4335.91, "timestamp": "01:12:15", "text": "去看其他 YouTuber，那些大 YouTuber 之类的，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.39, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "大多数人不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4342.149, "timestamp": "01:12:22", "text": "知道怎么做，等等，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4346.07, "timestamp": "01:12:26", "text": "他们会去看别人，然后做这个，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4350.229, "timestamp": "01:12:30", "text": "聊天什么的。 但是，有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4352.229, "timestamp": "01:12:32", "text": "人确实会通过被"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4355.51, "timestamp": "01:12:35", "text": "封禁、被纠正等等方式，以惨痛的代价来学习，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4358.07, "timestamp": "01:12:38", "text": "在虚拟主播的聊天室里应该如何表现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4360.39, "timestamp": "01:12:40", "text": "，它与直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4362.87, "timestamp": "01:12:42", "text": "主播、普通摄像头主播和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4365.27, "timestamp": "01:12:45", "text": "虚拟主播有什么不同，比如该说什么，不该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4368.229, "timestamp": "01:12:48", "text": "说什么，以及道德退场等等。 不。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4371.43, "timestamp": "01:12:51", "text": "所以我就想，如果我能有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4376.07, "timestamp": "01:12:56", "text": "地方，让人们可以一站式地阅读，如果他们愿意"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4379.018, "timestamp": "01:12:59", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZG